        "candidate_id": "C_4e17481d4f383268_0",
        "edit": "Changed the sensitivity list of the always block from `always@ (clk)` to `always@ (clk or d)` so the combinational assignment `q = d` re-evaluates whenever input `d` changes, matching the oracle's combinational behavior instead of latching only on clk edges.",
